# A pane's zoom and its history come back after a restart, so H goes back to the earlier zoom.
file <<END
Errands:
	- Post office
		Ask about the parcel
	- Buy milk
END
keys . .
see 󰋜 › Errands › Post office
restart
see 󰋜 › Errands › Post office
keys H
see 󰋜 › Errands
hide › Post office
keys H
see Buy milk
hide 󰋜 ›
